# Monitoring Agent — sample application logs
# Contains a realistic mix of FastAPI/uvicorn output:
#   - Routine noise (DEBUG, INFO, health checks, 2xx)
#   - A successful retry (WARNING then INFO)
#   - A FastAPI AttributeError traceback (multi-line)
#   - A database connection failure
#   - Repeated occurrences of the same AttributeError
#   - A second distinct error (KeyError)
#
# The monitoring agent should:
#   - Ignore all noise lines
#   - Group the traceback into ONE incident
#   - Group the DB error into ONE incident
#   - Suppress the repeated AttributeError (dedup)
#   - Alert on the separate KeyError as a new incident

